e=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -14.9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9.8pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">▶&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수강신청기간에 서버 폭주 예방 및 강좌 수요 예측 등을 위하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2018</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도부터 수강꾸러미 도입예정이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2018</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 수강신청때는 신규 개발된 수강꾸러미시스템의 시범운영으로 정식수강신청과 연계하지 않고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, 2018</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 수강신청때부터 수강꾸러미 신청내역을 정식수강신청과 연계하여 정식 운영예정임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강좌는 개설되었으나 수강꾸러미에는 비공개인 강좌도 있음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -14.9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">▶ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신입생은 학과에서 일괄적으로 수강 신청한 과목을 수강 취소 및 변경 불가합<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"> 니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style