.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -16.6pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">▶ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">▶ </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강지도상담 승인을 받지 않은 학생은 정식수강신청 기간에 수강신청시스템<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;로그인이 불가함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -16.6pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">다만 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2018-1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 복학생은 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">▶ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청은 원스톱서비스가 아닌 수강신청전용사이트에서 실시함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기간 학교홈페이지에 배너게시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -17.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9.8pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">※ &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수강지도상담 및 수강신청에 관한 상세사항은 추후 공지예정이오니 반드시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">확</span><span style=\"FONT-S